  "description": "Jang Han-Eul lives on his family's chicken farm in the countryside and the few friends he had moved away after graduation. Then a boy named Na-Mu comes from Seoul to visit his grandmother. Han-Eul is excited to make a new friend but is crestfallen when Na-Mu treats everyone kindly except him. Han-Eul wants them to be closer, but after Na-Mu drunkenly kisses him, Han-Eul becomes confused about what he actually wants. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US) \n\n*Note: Includes six Special Episodes and 14 Side Story chapters.*",
